# Editor bootstrap

- Full scene: `PolyPetsSceneBootstrap.BootstrapStarterHouseScene` (creates new scene)
- HUD-only: `CozyHudBuilder.ApplyCozyHudToOpenScene` (requires `=== SYSTEMS ===` + `=== UI ===`)
- Always persist critical refs with `SerializedObject` + `ApplyModifiedPropertiesWithoutUndo` + `SetDirty`
- Avoid `DisplayDialog` in any `-executeMethod` / batchmode path — use a silent wrapper that saves the scene
- First-run: `PolyPetsFirstRun` / `★ First-Time Setup`
- URP: `PolyPetsUrpSetup.EnsureUrpPipelineAssets` before material work
